WEBVTT

00:13:59.024 --> 00:14:01.140
"Kina može proizvesti ekonomski rast,"

00:14:01.140 --> 00:14:02.708
"i to nam se sviđa."

00:14:02.708 --> 00:14:05.422
Jer u krajnjoj liniji, pitanje pred nama,

00:14:05.422 --> 00:14:07.278
i pitanje pred

00:14:07.278 --> 00:14:08.983
sedam milijardi ljudi na planetu

00:14:08.983 --> 00:14:12.083
jest, kako možemo stvoriti blagostanje?

00:14:12.083 --> 00:14:14.998
Ljudi kojima je stalo i koji će se okrenuti modelu

00:14:14.998 --> 00:14:16.523
politike i ekonomije

00:14:16.523 --> 00:14:18.090
na vrlo razuman način,

00:14:18.090 --> 00:14:20.555
ka onim modelima koji će osigurati

00:14:20.555 --> 00:14:22.536
da mogu imati bolje životne standarde

00:14:22.536 --> 00:14:25.159
u najkraćem vemenskom roku.

00:14:25.159 --> 00:14:26.870
Dok danas napuštate ovo mjesto,

00:14:26.870 --> 00:14:28.275
voljela bih napustiti vas

00:14:28.275 --> 00:14:29.928
s vrlo osobnom porukom,

00:14:29.928 --> 00:14:32.014
koja je ono za što vjerujem